  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **BillyStrings2018-07-27.AKG414XLIIhypercard** (recommended): source not stated; 8 songs; 67 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BillyStrings2018-07-27.AKG414XLIIhypercard**: taped by Matt Coffey; transferred by Matt Coffey; source: AKG 414XLII's(Hyper,PAS,-6db,OTS,~10ft)> Sound Devices MixPre 6 (16/44.1) [1]. Also: Recorded by Matt Coffey, who also transferred and uploaded it, using AKG 414XLII microphones into a Sound Devices MixPre 6 at 16-bit/44.1kHz; Mics were set up in hypercardioid pattern, with pad engaged and -6 dB, about ten feet from the stage, on an OTS rig [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Burlington's Waterfront Park - Burlington, VT - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/burlington-s-waterfront-park-burlington-vt/) [3]",
